fact that there are at least two questionable facts implicit in this senten=
ce: whether Sam was killed, and if so, whether the falling rock killed him.=
 If Sam wasn't killed, the question of what killed him is moot.</para>
     <para>This type of problem becomes more evident when the subject of th=
e sentence turns out not to exist:</para>
     <example xml:id=3D"example-random-id-qgzq">
