-        <para>The King of Mexico did come to dinner.</para>
+      <para>The King of Mexico did come to dinner.</para>
     </example>
     <para>In the natural languages, we would be inclined to say that both =
of these statements are false, since there is no King of Mexico.</para>
     <para>The rest of this chapter is designed to explain the Lojban model=
 of negation.</para>
