-    <xref linkend=3D"example-random-id-gN3C"/> and=20
+      <xref linkend=3D"example-random-id-gN3C"/> and=20
     <xref linkend=3D"example-random-id-GtQC"/> have the advantage that, wh=
ile they contain a negative indication, they are in fact positive assertion=
s. They say what is true by excluding the false; they do not say what is fa=
lse.</para>
     <para>We can't always use=20
     <quote>non-</quote> though, because of the peculiarities of English's =
grammar. It would sound strange to say:</para>
