-        <para>(solecism, or improper grammatical action)</para>
+      <para>A: He ain't coming today.</para>
+      <para>B:=20
+      <quote>Ain't</quote> ain't a word.</para>
+      <para>(solecism, or improper grammatical action)</para>
     </example>
     <example xml:id=3D"example-random-id-qHJi">
